<title>FRANCE: French diplomatic coding specialists to go on strike.</title>
<headline>French diplomatic coding specialists to go on strike.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French foreign ministry's 300 coders - specialists who encode and decode secret messages between French ministries as well as to embassies round the world - will launch their first-ever strike on Monday, their union said on Friday.</p>
<p>The three-day renewable strike is over what the union said was the ministry's refusal to discuss parity in conditions between the coders and other ministry personnel.</p>
<p>The ministry had no immediate comment on the strike which the coders said might &quot;greatly hamper government activity.&quot;</p>
